# What never reaches the build context.
#
# Two jobs here, and the second one matters more than image size:
#
#   1. Keep the context small and the build reproducible — a host
#      `node_modules/` or `dist/` copied into the image would be whatever this
#      laptop happens to have, not what the lockfile describes.
#   2. Keep SECRETS and PERSONAL DATA out. This repository is public, the image
#      is not, and neither is allowed to carry the other's problems: the root
#      `.env` holds a database password and a JWT signing key, and the seed (which
#      lives outside the repository, so it cannot appear here anyway) carries the
#      community's clips, votes and listening history. Nothing from it reaches
#      the image. See `docker/seed.sh`.
#
# ⚠️ Deliberately NOT excluded: `**/*.spec.ts` and the `__tests__` /
# `__fixtures__` directories. It is tempting — none of it runs in the image —
# but the frontend's `npm run build` calls `vue-tsc --build`, which builds every
# project referenced from `tsconfig.json`, `tsconfig.vitest.json` included. Strip
# the specs out of the context and that project has no input files, which is a
# hard tsc error. The few hundred kilobytes buy a build that behaves exactly
# like the one a developer runs.

# ── Build inputs that must be regenerated, never copied ─────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime cache for the waveform job (downloaded episode mp3s, see
# packages/backend/src/waveform/waveform.constants.ts): gitignored, grows
# unbounded on a dev machine, and nothing in the Dockerfile COPYs it.
packages/backend/data/episodes

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.env.example` is the committed template and carries placeholders only; it is
# excluded too, because nothing in the image reads it — the container gets its
# configuration from the environment `docker-compose.yml` injects.
.env
.env.*
*.env

# ── Not part of the application ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
*.md
LICENSE

# Test infrastructure: the browser e2e suite. None of it runs inside this image.
test

# Tool caches
**/.eslintcache
**/.cache
**/.vite
**/.turbo
